To reverse the circuit diagram, you need to swap the battery terminals in the LaTeX code. Find these lines and swap them:

```latex
\node[left] at (-0.15, 3) {$+$};
\node[left] at (-0.15, 0) {$-$};
```

Should become:

```latex
\node[left] at (-0.15, 3) {$-$};
\node[left] at (-0.15, 0) {$+$};
```

And in the `\draw` command, flip the battery connection from `to[battery1, l=battery]` to `to[battery1, invert, l=battery]` or swap the coordinates from `to[battery1, l=battery]` to `to[battery1, l=battery]`.

